	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Nunquam hactenus ita de vobis desperavi, ut nunc despero, amantissime <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, postquam tam pie petentibus sic occursum est<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Es handelt sich um die eher kühle Antwort des <placeName ref="l587">Zürcher</placeName> Rates an die von Bürgermeister <persName ref="p8129">Jakob Meyer</persName> geführte <placeName ref="l28">Basler</placeName> Abordnung, die sich, nach Absprache mit den Bernern, um eine Aussöhnung zwischen <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName> und <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> bemüht hat, s. <bibl source="b5">HBBW III</bibl> <ref target="file10341">Nr. 310</ref>; vgl. <bibl source="b197">EA</bibl> IV/IC 236f; <hi>Kirchhofer,</hi> <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> 135f; <hi>Rudolf,</hi> Aussöhnungsversuch 511-517.</note>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Mendax <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>spiritus<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>1Kön 22, 22f</ref></cit>.</note> in istis versatur et superbus, unde responsio ista fluxit.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Causam video: Impietatis numerus augetur subinde in praesidentibus <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>plebi.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Timeo verum esse, quod ex <placeName ref="l760">Salodorensibus</placeName> nuper quidam<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Ein unbekannter <placeName ref="l760">Solothurner</placeName>.</note>: <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Prope est, ut haeresis illa tota pereat; restant duae civitates, <placeName ref="l41">Berna</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>et <placeName ref="l28">Basilaea</placeName> - nam <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> <placeName ref="l2448">Pagis</placeName> se dedidit -, quas sine labore <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>superabimus etc.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">An suspitione de istis carere possum, dum audio, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quid egerint modo?</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Non expendam verba singilatim, in <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>genere dico: Nihil boni, nihil pii video in toto responso.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Pios <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>aliud decebat.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Si non est, quod vos propter illos<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Gemeint sind die <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName>, vgl. auch <hi>Rudolf,</hi> Aussöhnungsversuch 516f.</note> offendit, cur <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>renuitis diligentiam reconciliationis?</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Scio, timetis <placeName ref="l2448">Pagos</placeName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">die <placeName ref="l2448">V Orte</placeName>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Non vultis, ut dicant: In amicitiam redierunt cum illis, qui <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>tam crudeliter eos in summis necessitatibus dereliquerunt<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Zu diesem Vorwurf an die <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> s. ausführlich <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Darstellung an <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> vom 22. Dezember 1533, <bibl source="b5">HBBW III</bibl> <ref target="file10337">Nr. 306</ref>; vgl. <hi>Rudolf,</hi> Aussöhnungsversuch 512-515.</note>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Con<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>venit vobis de <placeName ref="l2448">Pagis</placeName>, qui vestros occiderunt, qui bona abst<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ulerunt, qui nomini <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName> perpetuam inusserunt igno<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>miniam<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Nämlich: im Zweiten <placeName ref="l242">Kappelerkrieg</placeName>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quid?</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Non conveniet cum fratribus, qui, tametsi <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>laeserunt, nunc reconciliari petunt?</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Subest non, quod in super<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ioribus literis<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> an <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName>, 31. Dezember 1533, <bibl source="b5">HBBW III</bibl> <ref target="file10341">Nr. 310</ref>.</note> scripsisti, sed quod res mutari praesentes cupiant.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Pater ille noster<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Bürgermeister <persName ref="p8129">Jakob Meyer</persName> «zum Hirzen».</note> de vobis testatur bonum semen<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 13, 38</ref></cit>.</note> adhuc<pb type="edition" next="41"/> esse <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>inter vos in urbe, melius in agro<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Auf der Zürcher Landschaft.</note>, prout <persName ref="p1888">Laveterus</persName> [!]<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Gemeint ist sicherlich <persName ref="p1888">Hans Rudolf Lavater</persName>.</note> narrarit.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Caeterum vidisse quaedam se, propter quae doleat.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Qua <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>de re nihil ego in praesentiarum, sed de his modo, quae ex <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>literis tuis intelligo.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Sunt ea relata ad senatum per <persName ref="p8349">Rodulphum</persName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p8349">Hans Rudolf Frey</persName>, vgl. <hi>Kirchhofer,</hi> <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> 136.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ex legatis alterum.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Nam ex pede laborans aedes non exit <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><persName ref="p8129">consul</persName><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14"><persName ref="p8129">Jakob Meyer</persName>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Bone deus, quae de vobis desperatio suborta est!</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Quae <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>spes item papistis!</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Videbimus, inquiunt, quae bona deus <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>ille optimus cum sanctis suis agat et acturus sit per <placeName ref="l2448">Pagos</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>viros optimos et christianos.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Quidquid tentant, obtinent - <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>num sine dei auxilio?</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Quodsi hic auxiliatur, non possunt non <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>eius esse.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinis</placeName> nihil deest, nisi ut occasionem adipis<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>cantur redeundi ad ecclesiam.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Timent nonnihil adhuc <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>plebem, nam senatus lucrifactus est, sed propediem dabitur, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>ut et illa mutetur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Quam mihi dolet haec audire, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>pientissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, de tuis!</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Crede mihi, dolor impedit, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>ut scribere nesciam.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Vides perplexitatem enim.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Quid dicam?</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>En, capite<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Gemeint ist die <placeName ref="l587">zürcherische</placeName> Regierung, möglicherweise sogar Bürgermeister <persName ref="p2816">Diethelm Röist</persName> persönlich, vgl. <persName ref="p2979">Johann Jakob Simlers</persName> Bemerkung zu dieser Stelle, Zürich ZB, Ms S 35, Nr. 7.</note> morbus est.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Cura, quod in te est, ut sanetur.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Deum <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>in adiutorium invocato sine intermissione, quaere consilia et <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>noli confidere quibusdam, de quibus hactenus nimis candi<lb xml:id="p1z41"/>de sensisti.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la">Dies et noctes tecum et cum aliis consyderabis <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>de remedio ad caput sanandum.</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la">Quod si non inveneris,<pb type="scan" next="||50v."/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>actum esse video.</s>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la">Raptim haec.</s>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la">Dum opportunum fuerit, pluribus ero t<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ecum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum tuis, cum <persName ref="p3242">Utingero</persName>, <persName ref="p1753">Leone</persName><note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16"><persName ref="p1753">Leo Jud</persName>.</note>, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicano</persName>, <persName ref="p8171">Theodoro</persName><note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>omnibus.</s>
				</p>
